# URL of the ASP.NET Core API the frontend talks to.
#
# Leave this unset in production: the published app serves the SPA and the API
# from the same origin, so the frontend uses relative requests automatically.
#
# Set it when the frontend and API run on different origins. During local
# development this lives in `.env.development` (`http://localhost:5067`).
VITE_API_URL=
